{
  "name": "Dark One's Own Luck",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can call on your patron to alter fate in your favor. When you make an Ability Check or a Saving Throw, you can use this feature to add a d10 to your roll. You can do so after seeing the initial roll but before any of the roll's effects occur.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>",
